SCOPE
- Covered: our digitisation of the published phytosociological tables, added
  fields (e.g. georeferencing, tidy long-table structure), and documentation.
- Not covered: the Cambridge University Press book text, page scans / table
  images, or other CUP copyrighted material. Scans are intentionally excluded
  from this repository and from any DOI snapshot.

ATTRIBUTION (suggested)
McNicol, G., Sagole, B., Kumar, P., & Birks, H. J. B. (2026). Digitised
phytosociological relevés from Birks (1973), Isle of Skye (Version 1.0.0)
[Data set]. Zenodo. https://doi.org/XXXX  (DOI after minting)

Original survey and published source:
Birks, H. J. B. (1973). Past and Present Vegetation of the Isle of Skye.
Cambridge University Press. Part II, pp. 11–220. Field surveys ca. 1966–1969.
